   "widgets_values": [
    "## Live\n\nRealtime feedback with a turbo model (SDXL-Turbo, SD-Turbo, LCM, DMD2 at 1-4 steps). The Live Sampler plays inside the node, loops the camera, and can mirror a webcam (`live_source 0`) or a video, stream PNGs to a folder or Spout for Resolume / TouchDesigner / OBS.\n\nRender Options here sets a kaleidoscope symmetry in the loop."
   ]
